{
  "title": "Drums Practice",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Read the chart, play the",
        "pad, watch your timing.",
        "",
        "Header: +3 s12 is 3ms",
        "late, a spread of 12.",
        "Narrow is good.",
        "",
        "The bar at the bottom",
        "fills as the drill goes,",
        "hits/misses beside it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Playing",
      "lines": [
        "PLAY   listen, unscored",
        "REC    practise, scored",
        "Same button pauses; the",
        "other one switches.",
        "MENU   the drill list",
        "BACK   to the start,",
        "       then up, then out",
        "SHIFT+click  settings;",
        "  a run pauses under it",
        "",
        "A result: REC again,",
        "BACK to the start,",
        "CLICK the next drill.",
        "Only a whole take from",
        "the top is kept."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The list",
      "lines": [
        "Basics, the Learning",
        "Path, Grooves,",
        "Rudiments, Training and",
        "Quiz. Progress is last.",
        "",
        "Click opens, Back goes",
        "up. A groove opens its",
        "levels, one limb more",
        "each rung.",
        "",
        "A row shows your best",
        "clean speed: 80%. A",
        "tick is learned, a ring",
        "played but not clean."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Knobs",
      "lines": [
        "In a drill:",
        "1  scrub, when stopped",
        "8  speed, 50-120%",
        "",
        "Speed slows any drill,",
        "grooves and rudiments",
        "too. The tempo you play",
        "is what is recorded.",
        "",
        "In settings the knobs",
        "are the rows on screen,",
        "five to a page.",
        "Elsewhere they do",
        "nothing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The pads",
      "lines": [
        "Left half is your left",
        "hand, right half your",
        "right. Each voice owns a",
        "block; any pad in it",
        "counts.",
        "",
        "kit       the whole kit",
        "sticking  one surface"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Colours",
      "lines": [
        "green   you got it",
        "amber   right drum, but",
        "        WRONG HAND or",
        "        wrong dynamic",
        "red     you missed it",
        "yellow  your finger",
        "violet  now / playing",
        "purple  what is coming",
        "pulse   Study waits here"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Study",
      "lines": [
        "Settings > Study stops",
        "the scroll ON a note you",
        "missed. The lane names",
        "it; Guide pads pulse it.",
        "",
        "One press carries on."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scoring",
      "lines": [
        "Four things, counted",
        "apart, because each is",
        "fixed differently:",
        "",
        "timing   mean and spread",
        "drum     hit or miss",
        "hand     sticking error",
        "dynamic  accent / ghost"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Clean at tempo",
      "lines": [
        "A drill is learned when",
        "you play it CLEAN at its",
        "written tempo:",
        "",
        "90% of notes right -",
        "right drum, hand and",
        "dynamic, no strays -",
        "and the spread inside",
        "the Strict window.",
        "",
        "Your % is the fastest",
        "clean take: clean at",
        "Speed 80% reads 80%.",
        "100% is learned. Study",
        "takes do not count."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Learning Path",
      "lines": [
        "Four tracks side by",
        "side: Time, Rudiments,",
        "Grooves and Ear.",
        "",
        "Continue opens the next",
        "step of the track you",
        "left longest. Skip next",
        "passes one by. CLICK on",
        "a result goes on.",
        "",
        "Nothing is locked: a",
        "take anywhere counts.",
        "A groove learned at L4",
        "ticks L1-L3 too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Repetition",
      "lines": [
        "What you learned comes",
        "back after 1, 3, 7, 14",
        "and 30 days: a short",
        "daily routine.",
        "",
        "A clean take at tempo",
        "moves it further out; a",
        "slip brings it back",
        "tomorrow. Slow practice",
        "never counts as a slip,",
        "and your best never",
        "drops."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Progress",
      "lines": [
        "Each track: learned out",
        "of all. Then every",
        "drill you played, last",
        "first.",
        "",
        "CLICK a drill for its",
        "chart: each take's",
        "speed, the dotted line",
        "at 100%. Filled dots",
        "were clean."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The Ladder",
      "lines": [
        "Starts at 70% of the",
        "drill's tempo and climbs",
        "through it. Play N bars",
        "clean and it goes up.",
        "Slip and the rung plays",
        "again; slip twice and",
        "it stops.",
        "",
        "Your score is the top",
        "clean tempo, kept per",
        "drill and plotted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Latency",
      "lines": [
        "If every hit reads late",
        "by the same amount, that",
        "is your rig, not you.",
        "",
        "Settings > Latency takes",
        "it off every reading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sound",
      "lines": [
        "The module has its own",
        "kit and click. Nothing",
        "to set up.",
        "",
        "MIDI out can send to a",
        "track or USB instead."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
